    "detailed_description": "Blitz and Pieces is a retro FPS game with a focus on fast paced movement and interesting weapon combos.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMankind has been eradicated by a flesh eating pathogen. But luckily for you, you're not made of flesh.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game features:<br />\r\n- Many unique weapons that interact with each other in explosive ways<br />\r\n- A variety of enemy types<br />\r\n- Plenty of emergent movement tech<br />\r\n- 5 unique worlds, consisting of 5 levels each<br />\r\n- Lots of collectables and secret areas in every level<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou can choose your own play-style and kill enemies in whatever way you see fit.",
